WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.780
He does not steal money

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:08.220
he steals sleep

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.840
At night he slips into bedrooms

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:15.720
making no sound at all

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.780
and takes the sleep from people

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:23.580
stuffing it into a great sack

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.170
In the morning people wake up weary

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:31.610
with dark shadows under their eyes

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:39.780
they do not know their rest has been stolen

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.590
The thief goes home

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:47.640
and gives the stolen sleep

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:51.490
to his little sick daughter

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:55.860
who cannot rest because of the pain

00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:59.750
She drifts off at last

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:03.660
with a smile

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:09.730
And the thief watches her

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:12.430
his heart heavy

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:15.650
with being both

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:20.020
a criminal and a savior
